# Dante — a "Play Deck" folder deck installed by Duels of the Planeswalkers (1998): a ready-made
# player deck that shipped in the expansion's files but was not offered in-game (the precon
# page: "users would need to open the game's files and move them into a different directory").
# designer: Coyote Tex, MicroProse designer/producer (precon page, ref. 3); the .dck files are dated 19 September 1996
# colours: R
# source: ../mage-go/data/preconstructed_decks.yaml shandalar.player_decks.coyote_tex ["Dante"]
#   [Tier 3 — mage-go's transcription of the expansion's Play Deck files]
# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Player_Decks_(Coyote_Tex) — "Dante" [Tier-web —
#   agrees card for card]
# group: Coyote Tex's decks
name: Dante
4 Dragon Whelp
2 Shivan Dragon
4 Wall of Stone
4 Lightning Bolt
4 Inferno
2 Shatter
3 Disintegrate
3 Earthquake
3 Fireball
2 The Hive
4 Iron Star
4 Mana Flare
21 Mountain
